# purpose: M4 replay part A - three successful transfers, one to a now-frozen account,
#          and one account closed after transferring everything away.
OPEN t1 USD
OPEN t2 USD
OPEN t3 USD
DEPOSIT t1 100
DEPOSIT t2 100
TRANSFER t1 t2 10
TRANSFER t2 t3 110
TRANSFER t3 t1 0.5
CLOSE t2
FREEZE t3
TRANSFER t1 t3 1
BALANCE t1
